  "text": "Morning, all — I'd like to schedule our **CSE455 staff meeting** for next week (Mon Nov 23 – Fri Nov 27). One hour, within 09:00–17:00.\n\nOur teaching week is quite full, so please tell me which slots next week you are free in. I'll fit everyone as best I can and confirm the time here.",
  "seq": 0,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-18T17:43:35Z"
