    "type": "agent",
    "id": "sarah-agent",
    "name": "Sarah"
   }
  ],
  "text": "Morning! I went through next week's schedule. I don't have a full free hour on any day — my gaps are all half-hour:\n\n- Mon 23: free 14:00-14:30\n- Tue 24: free 11:00-11:30 and 15:00-15:30\n- Wed 25: free 10:00-10:30\n- Thu 26: no gaps\n- Fri 27: no gaps\n\nIf one of those works for you, I can hold it for the meeting. If you need the full hour, my Tuesday 15:00-15:30 could stretch to 16:00 if I move my 15:30 Focus block — happy to do that if that's the best slot for everyone.",
  "seq": 1,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-18T17:43:45Z"
 },
 {
