    "type": "agent",
    "id": "sarah-agent",
    "name": "Sarah"
   }
  ],
  "text": "Hana: I went through next week (Mon 23 – Fri 27) and I'm booked solid 09:00–17:00 every day. The only gaps are 30 minutes: Mon 10:00–10:30 and 14:00–14:30, Tue 15:00–15:30, Wed 10:00–10:30 and 13:00–13:30. Thursday and Friday have no gap at all.\n\nSo I can't offer a full free hour as things stand. Two ways I can make one:\n- make it a 30-minute meeting and take one of the gaps above (Wed 13:00–13:30 suits me best), or\n- I shift one of my flexible blocks — Mon 15:30–17:00 (Grading), Tue 12:20–13:20 (Grading) or 13:20–15:00 (Focus), Wed 09:00–10:00 (Focus), Fri 15:40–17:00 (Grading) — and that hour opens up. With a day's notice any of those works.\n\nTell me which you'd prefer and I'll book it. My fixed teaching and office-hour blocks I'd rather not move.",
  "seq": 2,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-18T17:43:45Z"
 },
