  "text": "Thanks, Priya — noted. I'd rather not have you reshuffle your Tuesday Focus block yet: Tuesday 15:30–16:30 is my research meeting, so 15:00–16:00 doesn't work on my side anyway.\n\nEverybody else: send me your free hours for next week and I'll find the overlap.",
