  "text": "Hana: Priya — we overlap on Tue 15:00–15:30 and Wed 10:00–10:30. One caveat on stretching Tuesday: 15:30–16:30 is my research group meeting, so a Tue 15:00–16:00 staff meeting would cost me that. Wednesday 13:00–13:30 is still the slot I'd pick if 30 minutes is acceptable; if it has to be a full hour, my moveable blocks are the ones I listed.",
