  "text": "Morning, Professor. I checked next week: my 09:00–17:00 is fully booked, and I'm afraid I have no free full hour anywhere Mon–Fri. The only gaps I have are half an hour each: Mon 10:00–10:30, Tue 11:00–11:30, Tue 15:00–15:30, Wed 10:00–10:30. Thursday and Friday have no gap at all.\n\nSo: if the meeting can be 30 minutes, I'm happy to take one of those. If it has to be a full hour, let me know and I'll look at what I can move.",
